<title>MALAYSIA: Telekom rises on requote in thin trade.</title>
<headline>Telekom rises on requote in thin trade.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telekom Malaysia Bhd rose on the stock's requotation following a one-day suspension on Monday to announce a Thai deal.</p>
<p>At 0150 GMT, the stock was up 30 cents to 12.80 ringgit on volume of 22,000 shares traded.  </p>
<p>Telekom on Monday said it was entering the Thai telecommunications market with the acquisition of a 20.12 percent stake in Samart Corp Plc.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
